From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] pdfcraft: rustix 1.1.6 (RUSTSEC-2026-0486)

RUSTSEC-2026-0486: rustix 1.1.5 marks unwritten bytes as initialized in the xattr functions when given a zero-length buffer (unsound); fixed in 1.1.6. Same windows-sys requirement, so only the rustix stanza and the dependents' "rustix 1.1.5" edges change. Cargo.lock only.
